name: "Sector Chip: [accent]Aftermath[]"
details: '''[lightgrey]
A sharded extraction site,
established by an automated process,
A method used commonly by the Crux.

Its sole surviving core has lost its
capability to construct any more photon
panels.

After the forces of the Exogens were
repelled, this sector was ultimately
left to rot.

Location:
- Depth: -3km - Sea level
- Depth Type: Illumination
- Location: Sector-69-kela
'''

